{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13216060","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13216060","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1321606001:0":{"text":"아나가 만난 괴상한 사람이 유령이었을 줄이야...!","source_cn":"没想到……亚娜遇见的怪人居然是个幽灵……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB122D9C685BFFD84","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1321606002:1":{"text":"다행히, 인간에게 적대심은 없는 것 같아요.","source_cn":"幸好，他看起来对人类没有敌意。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFEAD24C61C89ABA9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1321606003:1":{"text":"너희, 어째서... 이곳에 온 거지?","source_cn":"你们，为什么……来这里？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9AF204B710A582C1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1321606004:0":{"text":"어서 떠나... 여긴... 아이들이 놀만한 곳이 아니야...","source_cn":"快离开……孩子们……这里不是，玩耍的地方……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x95FA18C6E27C2B61","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1321606004":{"text":"어서 떠나... 여긴... 아이들이 놀만한 곳이 아니야...","source_cn":"快离开……孩子们……这里不是，玩耍的地方……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x95FA18C6E27C2B61","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1321606005:0":{"text":"네?! 저희가 아이들 같아 보이나요?","source_cn":"哎？！我们看起来很像小孩吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD6BBE8853B0E05AE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1321606006:1":{"text":"길을 잃은 아이가, 많아... 자주 있어...","source_cn":"迷路的孩子，好多……经常有……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xA4B9AD65E8AD3B56","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"길을 잃은 아이가, 많아... 자주 있어...","female":"길을 잃은 아이가, 많아... 자주 있어...","variant_male_record_index":"148791","variant_female_record_index":"148792","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1321606007:0":{"text":"여긴 전부 살아있는 시체라... 어른은, 오지 않아... 아이들뿐이야...","source_cn":"到处都是活死人……大人，不会来……只有小孩……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x4293AFEA72B33502","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"여긴 전부 살아있는 시체라... 어른은, 오지 않아... 아이들뿐이야...","female":"여긴 전부 살아있는 시체라... 어른은, 오지 않아... 아이들뿐이야...","variant_male_record_index":"148793","variant_female_record_index":"148794","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:10:1321606007":{"text":"여긴 전부 살아있는 시체라... 어른은, 오지 않아... 아이들뿐이야...","source_cn":"到处都是活死人……大人，不会来……只有小孩……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x4293AFEA72B33502","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"여긴 전부 살아있는 시체라... 어른은, 오지 않아... 아이들뿐이야...","female":"여긴 전부 살아있는 시체라... 어른은, 오지 않아... 아이들뿐이야...","variant_male_record_index":"148793","variant_female_record_index":"148794","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1321606008:0":{"text":"나...? 내가 왜 여기에... 난...","source_cn":"我……？我为什么在这里……我……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x357C1AC8F74EDA0B","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"나...? 내가 왜 여기에... 난...","female":"나...? 내가 왜 여기에... 난...","variant_male_record_index":"148795","variant_female_record_index":"148796","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1321606009:0":{"text":"...기억이 나질 않아...","source_cn":"……我不记得了……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xA16D984CA53C4A3B","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"...기억이 나질 않아...","female":"...기억이 나질 않아...","variant_male_record_index":"148797","variant_female_record_index":"148798","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1321606010:0":{"text":"마스터, 자세히 보니 이 유령은 단지 키가 큰 것뿐, 나이는 그리 많지 않은 것 같아요!","source_cn":"主人，仔细一看，这个幽灵的年纪好像也不是很大，只是个子...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x884F6EB00656AD38","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"마스터, 자세히 보니 이 유령은 단지 키가 큰 것뿐, 나이는 그리 많지 않은 것 같아요!","female":"마스터, 자세히 보니 이 유령은 단지 키가 큰 것뿐, 나이는 그리 많지 않은 것 같아요!","variant_male_record_index":"148799","variant_female_record_index":"148800","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1321606011:1":{"text":"설마, 이 사람도 길을 잃어서 이곳에 오게 된 걸까요? 그리고...","source_cn":"难不成，他也是因为迷路来到这里的？最后又……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBC654593D6E81E05","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1321606012:1":{"text":"너희, 아이가 아니라... 어른이야, 길을 알아...","source_cn":"你们，不是小孩……是大人，认得路……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x56F0BE26C6EF2F1E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1321606013:0":{"text":"그러니... 너희들이 나를 집으로 데려다줄 수 있어... 그렇지?","source_cn":"所以……你们可以，带我回家……对不对？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB36B0484A7671CD7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1321606014:0":{"text":"잠깐, 갑자기 당신을 데리고 집으로 돌아가 달라고요?!","source_cn":"——等一下，怎么又扯到带你回家的事了？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x209683BED0080AC8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1321606015:1":{"text":"집이 어디에요? 참, 아직 이름도 못 물어봤네요.","source_cn":"你的家在哪？对了，我们还不知道你的名字呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5542478A67910C56","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1321606016:1":{"text":"이름은... 데미...","source_cn":"名字是……德米……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD71511885DAE486A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1321606017:0":{"text":"우리 집은... 어디에 있는지 모르겠어... 하지만 어머니에게, 어머니에게 가야 해...","source_cn":"我的家在……我不知道在哪……但是母亲在那里，我要去找母亲……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x910B5C8D7D40119D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1321606018:0":{"text":"음, 집이 어디인지 모른다면 곤란한데...","source_cn":"唔，忘记家在哪就难办了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAD6B9D4055616B7E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1321606019:0":{"text":"대략적인 위치는 기억하고 있나요? 아니면... 기억에 남는 장소라도 괜찮아요! 집처럼 중요한 곳은 아무리 기억을 잃어도 희미하게 기억하기 마련이니까요.","source_cn":"大概的位置你还能想起来吗？或者……记忆比较深刻的地方也...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB0693E9F5173E0FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1321606020:1":{"text":"기억에 남는 거... <style=\"highlight\">남쪽 호수</style>가 얼어서, 구멍을 뚫었어... 그리고... <style=\"highlight\">북쪽 절벽 위</style>, 폐허 속에 맛있는 열매가 있어...","source_cn":"印象深刻的……<style=highlight>南边的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x282EF85A802CAB74","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1321606021:1":{"text":"정말 이상하네요. 그가 기억하는 두 곳은 마침 정반대 방향이에요.","source_cn":"真奇怪，他印象深刻的两个地方刚好方向相反呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF44106F3C4639C2A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1321606022:0":{"text":"됐어요, 일단은 가보는 게 좋겠어요! 그의 집이 그 두 곳 근처에 있을지도 모르잖아요!","source_cn":"算了，我们还是先过去看看吧！说不定他家就在这两个地方附近！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6353ABAB81BED832","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:10:0:1":{"text":"그럼 넌 왜 여기에 있는 거야?","source_cn":"那你为什么会在这里？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x7D6B86206B9DD4CD","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"그럼 넌 왜 여기에 있는 거야?","female":"그럼 넌 왜 여기에 있는 거야?","variant_male_record_index":"69554","variant_female_record_index":"69555","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:6:0:1":{"text":"아이들? 너희 둘을 말하는 건가?","source_cn":"小孩？是在说你们俩吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xA21AB8C4F0CC5ADF","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"아이들? 너희 둘을 말하는 건가?","female":"아이들? 너희 둘을 말하는 건가?","variant_male_record_index":"69550","variant_female_record_index":"69551","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:6:1:2":{"text":"내가 어린아이 같아 보이진 않잖아?","source_cn":"我怎么看也不像小孩吧？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x4BE15C60AE7FAD16","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"내가 어린아이 같아 보이진 않잖아?","female":"내가 어린아이 같아 보이진 않잖아?","variant_male_record_index":"69552","variant_female_record_index":"69553","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:好心的幽灵":{"text":"착한 유령","source":"好心的幽灵","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:幽灵德米":{"text":"유령 데미","source":"幽灵德米","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":28,"localized_text_count":27,"speaker_count":4}}